+   "h2": "What happens if the test says the battery needs replacing?",
+   "html": "<p>We fit and register batteries on BMW, Mercedes-Benz and Audi. Registration matters because many of these cars track the battery and adjust charging to suit it, so a new battery should be registered with a diagnostic tool. Our guide to <a href=\"/bmw-mercedes-battery-replacement-registration-singapore/\">BMW and Mercedes battery replacement and registration</a> explains why.</p>\n<p>The replacement should match the type your car was built for. Cars with start-stop usually need an AGM or EFB battery rather than a standard one, matched in size and terminal layout to the original.</p>"
+  },
