+   "h2": "What if the battery tests fine but the car still struggles?",
+   "html": "<p>A healthy battery with a car that still will not start or keeps going flat points elsewhere: a charging fault, a drain that runs when the car is off, a loose or corroded connection, or a starter problem. Further diagnosis finds the real cause before parts are replaced. See our <a href=\"/services/car-diagnostics-warning-lights/\">car diagnostics and warning lights</a> service, or the <a href=\"/services/european-car-servicing/\">European car servicing</a> page if the car is also due for a service.</p>"
